                                "sense_id": "58b41509-a0e1-3d1a-875b-a2d70d0e7cb3",
                                "text": "On passing to the recalescent properties of these alloys, as shown in Mr. Osmond's experiments, a remarkable difference would also be noticed between the alloys H and I."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "83eb5664-993a-41e2-a694-dd541f92a914",
                                "sense_id": "58b41509-a0e1-3d1a-875b-a2d70d0e7cb3",
                                "text": "If more than one recalescent event is present in the eutectic growth region T23 and T31 will be defined as being associated with the major recalescent event."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7c94f954-c95c-4087-991d-abbee9ef59a2",
                                "sense_id": "58b41509-a0e1-3d1a-875b-a2d70d0e7cb3",
                                "text": "Pure (electrolytic) iron possesses the recalescent properties, but ferro-manganese does not."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
